WEBVTT

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.100
Literally

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:12.490
the creamiest, most non-burnt,
non-acidic shot of espresso I've had

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.390
from an automated espresso machine.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.760
What I love most about my Terra Kaffe

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:25.450
TK-02 machine is not only
the fact that its internal

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.920
espresso tamping parts

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.560
utilize scientific weighted measurements

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.160
to pull you the most caramelized, creamy,

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.740
clean, non-acidic extractions
of espresso bean.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.380
But

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.910
if anything were to go wrong, because
I'm renting it through Terra Kaffe and

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.920
Whim,

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:49.680
I have support staff behind me
to help me triage the problem.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.410
If it's not something that they
can walk me through triage-wise,

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.550
they'll send me a replacement part, or
they'll send me shipping materials to

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.440
send the entire machine back
if something were to go wrong.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.120
So that's the beauty, right?

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.590
Not only do I have my 6:00 AM pick-me-up
before my 7:00 AM meetings because I

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:12.410
am a remote at-home worker, so this
is my fuel for my Eastern Standard

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.420
Time clients,

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:19.870
but I also have the peace of mind
that I'm not paying $1,400 for a

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:20.880
machine

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.840
and the warranty doesn't cover maybe

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.590
a portion of what's occurring with it
or all of what's occurring with it.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:28.980
Maybe the warranty expired.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.030
Either way you look at it, I think
the rental option is beautiful.

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.740
For a small amount a month,
a little over $100 a month,

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.490
you have 24/7 support on triaging any
issues that happen with your machine.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.970
So I just think this is the most
beautiful concept for a beautiful machine

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:50.640
that pulls the most
delicious espresso shots.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.030
Thanks, Terra Kaffe.
